.TH CRS-PROVISION-DESKTOP 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-controlroom-setup 1.0.0" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
crs\-provision\-desktop \- write the XFCE launchers for the DAQ applications assigned to a VNC session
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B crs\-provision\-desktop
.B \-\-session
.I NAME
.RB [ \-\-session
.IR NAME ]...\&
.RB [ \-\-desktop\-dir
.IR DIR ]
.br
.B crs\-provision\-desktop \-\-all\-local
.RB [ \-\-desktop\-dir
.IR DIR ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs on a DAQ host as the session account.
For every inventory entry whose
.B sessions
list intersects the requested session names, writes
.IB DIR / id \-start.desktop
and
.IB DIR / id \-stop.desktop
with
.BI Exec= $CRS_HOME /bin/crs\-app
.BR start | stop
.I id
(the path written is absolute, with
.B ~
already expanded), makes them executable and marks them gio\-trusted
.RB ( "gio set FILE metadata::trusted true" ;
failure ignored).
.PP
.B \-\-session
names are not checked against
.IR controlroom.yaml .
An application whose sessions are all undefined there gets no launcher
anywhere; with the shipped configuration that is eight of twelve, and
only
.B shift\-main
receives launchers (controlcenter, bigredbox, downtime\-logger,
trigger\-scalers);
.B dcs\-main
and
.B trig\-main
receive none.
Launchers of applications no longer assigned are not removed.
.PP
.B \-\-all\-local
selects the sessions in
.I controlroom.yaml
whose
.B account
is
.B $USER
and whose host short name is this host's.
.PP
The configuration files are read with PyYAML when the system
.B python3
can import it, otherwise with the restricted parser inside
.BR crs\-app (1).
That parser understands only the
.B apps:
list: under it
.B \-\-all\-local
finds no sessions and exits 1, and every
.B terminal:
value is read as a non\-empty string, so every launcher is written with
.BR Terminal=true .
.B \-\-session
is unaffected.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-session " NAME"
session name; repeatable; exclusive with
.BR \-\-all\-local .
.TP
.B \-\-all\-local
as above.
.TP
.BI \-\-desktop\-dir " DIR"
default
.IR ~/Desktop .
.SH FILES
.IR ~/controlroom/etc/apps.yaml ,
.IR ~/controlroom/etc/controlroom.yaml .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CRS_HOME
install area (default
.IR ~/controlroom ).
.TP
.B USER
account matched by
.BR \-\-all\-local .
.SH EXIT STATUS
0, including when no application matched (a message says so);
1 when
.B \-\-all\-local
finds no session; 2 on a command\-line error.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
crs\-provision\-desktop \-\-session shift\-main
crs\-provision\-desktop \-\-all\-local
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR crs\-app (1),
.BR crs\-remote (1),
.BR apps.yaml (5)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group.
